\details{
The four functions differ in the input geometry family and output format:
\itemize{
\item \code{ddbh3_polygons_to_h3()} / \code{ddbh3_lines_to_h3()} add a list column with
the H3 cells intersecting each feature, as strings or \code{UBIGINT}
\item \code{ddbh3_polygons_to_spatial()} / \code{ddbh3_lines_to_spatial()} return one row
per (feature, intersecting cell), with the geometry replaced by the H3
